## B. Search / filter + pagination (combined)

| ID | What breaks | Repro | Sev |
|----|-------------|-------|-----|
| **PAGE-SEARCH-01** | User on `?q=foo&page=3`; narrows search to 1 page of results → still `page=3` → empty | Type new `q` while on high page **if** form submits hidden `page` | 🟠 |
| **PAGE-SEARCH-02** | Pagination links drop `q` / `status` / `published` after fix for member `:id` | Search → page 2 → `q` missing in href | 🟠 |
| **PAGE-SEARCH-03** | Filter via turbo frame updates list but header shows **unfiltered** total count | Search → `#house_series_total_count` stale | 🟠 |
| **PAGE-SEARCH-04** | Redirect/repage after delete drops `q` → user sees full list after filtered delete | Delete on `?q=foo&page=2` → redirect without `q` | 🟠 |
| **PAGE-SEARCH-05** | Clear search (`q=`) while on page 5 → empty or wrong slice | Clear input on page 5 without reset to page 1 | 🟡 |
| **PAGE-SEARCH-06** | `no_results` vs `no_records` wrong when overflow vs truly empty filter | `q=zzz` on page 5 vs no data at all | 🟡 |
| **PAGE-SEARCH-07** | Delete destroy URL missing `q` / `page` → repage wrong scope | Delete from detail modal while filtered | 🟠 |
| **PAGE-SEARCH-08** | Auto-submit search debounce: rapid typing leaves URL with old `q` and new list | Fast type + paginate before debounce fires | 🟡 |
| **PAGE-SHARED-01** | Feature-specific page/filter logic added to a **shared** auto-submit (or similar) controller → other forms/lists regress | Change shared submit helper “for one index” without opt-in | 🟠 |
| **PAGE-CTX-01** | DELETE from modal/detail: `params[:page]` / `q` absent on request | Delete on `?q=foo&page=5` opened from modal | 🟠 |
| **PAGE-COERCE-01** | `page` nil/0/abc coerced wrong: repage never runs or always page 1 | `Pagination::PageParam.coerce(page, default: nil)` vs `default: 1` | 🟡 |

### Search + page interaction (design rules for codegen)

| Event | Expected page behavior |
|-------|------------------------|
| **New search / filter change** | Reset to **page 1** (drop `page` param or set `page=1`) |
| **Paginate** | Keep all active filter params (`q`, `status`, `published`, …) |
| **Delete / bulk delete** | Repage within **filtered** scope; preserve `q` in URL |
| **GET with `page` > filtered total_pages** | Redirect to last valid page **with same filters** |
| **Clear search** | Page 1 + full unfiltered list |

### Filter form checklist

- [ ] Filter form must **not** include hidden `page` unless it resets to `1` on `q` change  
- [ ] Prefer reset via **omitting `page` from the filter form** (GET only sends form fields) — not a new default in a shared auto-submit controller (**PAGE-SHARED-01**; see `shared-abstraction-safety.mdc`)  
- [ ] OR explicitly reset page via Stimulus **opt-in** / feature-scoped controller — not silent shared default  
- [ ] `paginate(..., params:)` must **merge** route params **and** `permit(q:, status:, published:, …)` — not only `{ controller:, action:, id: nil }`  
- [ ] `redirect_to` / `history-replace` URL built from **same helper** as delete links (`index_list_url`)  
- [ ] DELETE without query params: fallback **`request.referer`** parse OR Stimulus `window.location.search` for `q`/`page` (`confirm_delete`)  
- [ ] Shared `Pagination::PageParam.coerce` — `default: nil` when detecting overflow; `default: 1` when loading page  

**Example `index_list_url` (Rails — house series `25da272`):**

```ruby
def index_list_url(page: nil)
  house_series_properties_path({
    q: @query.presence,
    published: @published.presence,
    page: (page.to_i > 1 ? page : nil)
  }.compact)
end
```

