## C. Param preservation & security

| ID | What breaks | Repro | Sev |
|----|-------------|-------|-----|
| **PAGE-PARAM-01** | Repage redirect drops filter params | Overflow redirect without `q` | 🟠 |
| **PAGE-PARAM-02** | Pagination leaks unpermitted params into links | Evil param in URL echoed in `page=2` href | 🟡 |
| **PAGE-PARAM-03** | Member `:id` stuck in pagination after detail modal | Open detail → paginate (see TURBO-URL-01) | 🟠 |

**Fix:** Single `index_query_params` / `index_list_url` helper — `permit` only; use for paginate, redirect, delete, history-replace.

**Pagination link params (still verify PAGE-SEARCH-02):**

```ruby
pagination_params = {
  controller: "house_series",
  action: "index",
  id: nil,
  q: query.presence,
  published: index_published
}.compact_blank
```

