## G. DDD / spec edge cases (Stage 3)

When BD/DDD describes a searchable paginated list, **Non-goals** must not skip:

1. Delete last item on last page **while filtered**  
2. Search while on high page number  
3. Empty filter result vs overflow empty page (different copy)  
4. Refresh with stale `page` + active `q`  

